Z||000003||honegod||12-19-2001||02:05 AM||||I know that earlier rims have the right bolt circle, but I think I read that the lateer rims use a DIFFERENT bolt circle, and won't bolt up.<BR>I do not KNOW that is correct though, but it MIGHT be, so the thing to do is to whip off one of your wheels and SEE if the rim will fit on the lug studs, if the wheel goes on at all, it is OK.||||reg||1
